2. The following offences may be compounded by any public officer authorised in that behalf by the Minister in accordance with section 82(5)(a) of the Act:
(a)an offence under paragraph 6(5), 7(6), 8(4), 13, 17(5)(a), 18(5)(b) or 20(2) of the Air Navigation (Aviation Security) Order (O 5);
(b)an offence under paragraph 10(3), 13(2), 14(2), 16(3) or 18 of the Air Navigation (Regulated Air Cargo Agents) Order (O 8) as in force immediately before 15 May 2017;
(c)an offence under regulation 11(2), 11A(2), 16(2), 19(4) or 19C(2) of the Air Navigation (Regulated Air Cargo Agents and Known Consignors) Regulations 2017 (G.N. No. S 166/2017);
[S 986/2020 wef 04/12/2020]
(d)[Deleted by S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(e)an offence under section 68(1) or (2), read with section 68(4), of the Act;
[S 623/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(f)an offence under section 67(3) of the Act;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(g)an offence under regulation 14(2) of the Air Navigation (Licensing of Air Services) Regulations (Rg 2).
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
[S 623/2024 wef 31/12/2021]

3. The following offences may be compounded by the Director‑General of Civil Aviation or any officer of the Authority authorised in that behalf by the Director‑General of Civil Aviation in accordance with section 82(5)(b) of the Act:
(a)any offence under —
(i)paragraph 50C(1) or (2), 50D(1) or (2) or 50DB(1) or (3), read with paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order (O 2) as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(ii)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 1 of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(iii)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 2 of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(iv)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 3 of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(v)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 4(1) of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(4), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(vi)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 4(2) of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(vii)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 7(1) or (2) of Part II of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(5), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(viii)paragraph 50E(2), read with paragraph 1 of Part III of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(6), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(ix)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 2(1) or (1A) of Part IV of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(5), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(x)paragraph 50E(1), read with paragraph 2(2) of Part IV of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(4), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xi)paragraph 50E(2), read with paragraph 2(1) or (1A) of Part IV of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(5), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xii)paragraph 50E, read with paragraph 1(1) or (2) or 2(1) or (2) of Part V of the Nineteenth Schedule and paragraph 80(4), of the Air Navigation Order as in force immediately before 1 January 2023;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xiii)paragraph 50G(1) or (2) or 50H(3) as in force immediately before 1 January 2023, or 64H, read with paragraph 80(4), of the Air Navigation Order;
[S 107/2020 wef 15/02/2020]
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xiv)[Deleted by S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xv)regulation 4(2), 5(2), 6(2), 14(2), 18(2), 19(5), 24(3), 29(3), 32(3), 33(4), 34(2), 39(3), 40(2), 42(3), 47(2) or 48(1) or (5) of the Air Navigation (101 — Unmanned Aircraft Operations) Regulations 2019 (G.N. No. S 833/2019);
[S 107/2020 wef 15/02/2020]
[S 107/2020 wef 01/03/2020]
[S 107/2020 wef 02/04/2020]
[S 108/2020 wef 01/06/2020]
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xvi)regulation 10(1), 20(2), 25(2) or 35(3) of the Air Navigation (101 — Unmanned Aircraft Operations) Regulations 2019, read with section 14(3) of the Act;
[S 107/2020 wef 15/02/2020]
[S 108/2020 wef 01/06/2020]
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xvii)regulation 5(1) of the Air Navigation (92 — Carriage of Dangerous Goods) Regulations 2022 (G.N. No. S 998/2022), read with section 14(3) of the Act; or
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(xviii)regulation 10(7), 11(2), 12(3) or (4), 14(3), 16(3), 17(5) or (6), 18(4) or (5), 19(3) or (4), 22(2), 23(2), 24(7), (8) or (9) or 25(4) or (5) of the Air Navigation (92 — Carriage of Dangerous Goods) Regulations 2022;
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
(b)an offence under section 35(1) of the Act.
[S 623/2024 wef 01/08/2024]
[S 623/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
